WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.025
You came to do the work. Not chase a file, repeat an
update, or wonder who's doing what.

2
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:15.950
Meet MemoValet. One place for your projects, notes, files
and next steps. See what needs you, and get moving.

3
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:25.750
Start with a project. Keep the details with it. Give the
work an owner, and stop digging through yesterday's
messages.

4
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:38.725
Share the document. Send the photos. Put what someone
needs in their hands, through MemoValet or email. Your
team, your client, your contractor.

5
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:50.450
A job on site? Include the location. Keep the update with
the task. See what's moving, what's waiting, and what
needs a follow-up.

6
00:00:54.200 --> 00:01:02.900
And when you meet, keep the useful part: notes, decisions
and transcripts, with translation when you need it. Ready
to return to and share.

7
00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:12.475
Less time piecing things together. More time doing the
work you came to do. At your desk, or out getting it done.

8
00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.700
MemoValet. Your work, in the right hands. Explore it at
memo valet dot com.

